{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 153,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4244384765625,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "In formulating the recommendations, the GDG assessed the overall balance between benefits and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3240356445312,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "harms of an (H)REZ–levofloxacin regimen; they also considered values and preferences (paying special",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967351913452148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4199829101562,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "attention to considerations of equity, acceptability and feasibility), in addition to clinical outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.88072967529297,
        527.43017578125,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "Annex 5 and the potential risks of increasing toxicities (see  for details). The conclusions of the GDG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.2852172851562,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "were that a regimen composed of 6 months of REZ plus fluoroquinolones was associated with higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994348526000977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        524.3928833007812,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "treatment success rates (with or without the addition of isoniazid). The difference between the 6(H)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4244995117188,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "REZ and >6(H)REZ regimens was modest, slightly favouring the 6-month regimen (not statistically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.4364624023438,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "significant). The GDG acknowledged that it was not possible to control for all possible confounding",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.4310913085938,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "by indication when comparing the 6(H)REZ and >6(H)REZ regimens. As an example, although data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.44091796875,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "on the extent of disease were not systematically captured for all patients, it is possible that a larger",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        527.4309692382812,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "number of cases with extensive disease received >6(H)REZ regimens, resulting in poor outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.59071350097656,
        523.35888671875,
        227.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "for this group of patients (given the extent of disease) and possibly favouring the 6(H)REZ regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.2946319580078,
        527.5892333984375,
        248.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "The GDG acknowledged the safety implications of (H)REZ–levofloxacin, particularly the hepatotoxicity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984539031982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.49464416503906,
        527.4478759765625,
        261.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "associated with prolonged use of pyrazinamide-containing multidrug regimens. However, reducing the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.952949523925781,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.694580078125,
        527.5180053710938,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "duration of the treatment with pyrazinamide to 3 months or less was associated with worse treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983887672424316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.5634765625,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "outcomes, at least in Hr-TB regimens without a fluoroquinolone. Furthermore, the use of streptomycin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972014427185059,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3982543945312,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "in these regimens was associated with no significant added benefit. The use of streptomycin and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.0186767578125,
        527.422607421875,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "(102–104) other injectable agents has also been associated with increased serious adverse events  . On",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.992096900939941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        527.4144897460938,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "this basis, the GDG agreed that current data supported the use of the (H)REZ–levofloxacin regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.6947021484375,
        527.2596435546875,
        341.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "without streptomycin or any other injectable agent in Hr-TB cases, unless there is a compelling reason",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981134414672852,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.89471435546875,
        356.0961608886719,
        354.3377380371094
      ],
      "text": "to use these agents (e.g. certain forms of polydrug resistance).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.5958251953125,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also noted that patients were likely to place a high value on a 6-month regimen, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.1957397460938,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "likelihood of a relapse-free successful outcome and, especially, the implementation of a regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.4788208007812,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "without the use of injectable agents. GDG members agreed that the use of the 6(H)REZ regimen would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95887279510498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.5614624023438,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "probably increase health equity, given that the cost of the components is relatively low (compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        527.4376220703125,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "the recommended regimens for MDR/RR-TB) and the increased probability of cure in a substantial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.4058227539062,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "number of patients. In addition, the exclusion of streptomycin and other injectable agents reduces",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        272.7964172363281,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "potential barriers to regimen administration.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.5025939941406,
        527.5322875976562,
        476.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "Although patient costs were not factored into the analysis, the GDG agreed that improving diagnostic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983137130737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.7025146484375,
        527.4376831054688,
        490.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "capacity to detect isoniazid resistance would be beneficial. A modelling analysis performed for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.6266174316406,
        527.4378662109375,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant tuberculosis  2011 update of the WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.980132102966309,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.82659912109375,
        527.4476928710938,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "(13)  estimated that the best strategy for averting deaths and preventing acquired MDR-TB was to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.302490234375,
        527.4144897460938,
        529.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "undertake DST in all patients before treatment, using a rapid test that detects resistance to isoniazid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        527.2265625,
        527.3994140625,
        542.945556640625
      ],
      "text": "(105) and rifampicin  . The modelling work also showed that rapid testing for resistance to both isoniazid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.959826469421387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        527.4168090820312,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "and rifampicin at the time of diagnosis was the most cost-effective testing strategy for any patient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        527.61572265625,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "group or setting, even at very low levels of resistance among TB patients (MDR-TB in >1% and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        298.49676513671875,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid resistance [other than MDR-TB] in >2%).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.8065185546875,
        527.4430541992188,
        604.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "In general, the GDG considered that the use of the 6(H)REZ–levofloxacin regimen would be feasible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.0064697265625,
        527.1934814453125,
        617.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "in most DR-TB treatment settings, and that the use of a regimen based on medicines that are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.20654296875,
        527.4046020507812,
        630.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "administered orally may increase feasibility. Altogether, based on present evidence, when discussing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.406494140625,
        527.4024047851562,
        643.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "the balance between benefits and harms, preferences and values for patients and other end-users,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.6065063476562,
        527.4922485351562,
        657.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "the GDG reached overall agreement on the beneficial effect that the Hr-TB regimen may have, if used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98373794555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.8065185546875,
        527.4378662109375,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "in conformity with these policy recommendations. Although there was no clear evidence to suggest",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0064697265625,
        527.3871459960938,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "that the addition of isoniazid to this regimen would be beneficial, the four-drug (H)REZ fixed-dose",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.20654296875,
        527.1864013671875,
        696.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "combination (FDC) may be more convenient for the patient and the health service because it removes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969608306884766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.406494140625,
        203.86712646484375,
        709.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "the need to use single drugs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.1104125976562,
        527.5363159179688,
        731.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "Consistent with the overall framework for the management and care of patients diagnosed with DR-TB,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.951041221618652,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.3104248046875,
        527.1803588867188,
        744.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "careful selection of patients is a fundamental principle. Ahead of starting the (H)REZ–levofloxacin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.5103759765625,
        527.1846923828125,
        757.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "regimen, it is essential that resistance to rifampicin be excluded, using WHO-recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.4343872070312,
        527.4166259765625,
        771.1533813476562
      ],
      "text": "(41, 106) genotypic or phenotypic methods  . Ideally, resistance to fluoroquinolones (and, if possible,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  139",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}